    "body": "**Use case**\r\nRecent release adds 24 hour rolling location history. This is a privacy problem, and not required, though it may be useful \r\n\r\n\r\n**Proposed Solution**\r\nAdd option to disable trail. \r\nAdd first run question (default to more private) \r\n\r\nYou might want to think about this from a GDPR data minimisation point of view... \r\n\r\n",
